Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[{
 "03",
 StyleBox["Synapses",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "Plasticity",
 StyleBox["And",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "Glia_Coupling"
}], "Title",ExpressionUUID->"265fce76-99df-0b4b-b5d6-df055e008bdd"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Purpose", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"86afe3a7-61ce-384d-9961-43cf64357bdd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is ",
 StyleBox["Notebook 3",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " in the Neuron Series."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eee29fc8-f1ad-5d44-8aaa-046bf492651f"],

Cell["\<\
Its goal is to extend the neuron from an isolated dynamical membrane model \
into a fully adaptive signaling system by incorporating:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8f2a4f1d-6a0f-9143-9bc5-ed087ca45ded"],

Cell["1. synaptic transmission,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9d83f90d-520e-8c46-a9b9-0814eb2b74a1"],

Cell["2. receptor-specific conductance dynamics,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"83a68cfe-dea0-204c-b68a-a548935c9bd1"],

Cell["3. short-term synaptic plasticity,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"83e48d7f-36ef-4641-9795-3257fe8083e3"],

Cell["4. long-term plasticity and learning rules,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b160eb38-bcb6-8c44-b88a-8c64de68e0ca"],

Cell["5. modulatory influences,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a7435879-273e-9846-8d01-e026eb28559e"],

Cell["6. glia and astrocyte coupling,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b28feaee-98ec-9547-9857-c3892d8e95af"],

Cell["\<\
7. digital approximations suitable for advanced artificial neural \
architectures.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2ba3a3e3-581a-3245-bcdd-2df07c79677b"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook is essential because a neuron without synapses and plasticity \
is not yet a computational organism. Synapses are the \
neuron\[CloseCurlyQuote]s measurement interfaces to other cells, and \
plasticity is the mechanism by which past interaction shapes future dynamics.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d79b82be-c688-5e4e-bcc4-c45e41bb9142"],

Cell["The methodological rule is: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ddc28d05-6e08-b047-bdf9-f5b61fec1ed1"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {
    PaneBox["\<\"every coupling mechanism must be represented either as a \
state variable, a transfer law, a memory process, or a learning rule.\"\>",
     BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[0.35], 
         GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
     ImageMargins->5,
     ImageSize->{Full, Automatic},
     ScrollPosition->{0., 0.}]}
  },
  AutoDelete->False,
  GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
       LightDarkSwitched[
        GrayLevel[1], 
        GrayLevel[0.278317]]}}},
  GridBoxDividers->{"ColumnsIndexed" -> {1 -> Directive[
        LightDarkSwitched[
         RGBColor[0.87, 0.94, 1], 
         RGBColor[0.2491127, 0.3295188, 0.4231198]], 
        AbsoluteThickness[4]]}, "Rows" -> {{False}}},
  GridBoxItemSize->{
   "Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], "Text", \
"BlockQuote",
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"dc5bcb33-0f7a-4d40-b4e2-1549eadc1678"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"11101678-1f90-4044-8c4b-d5540215dfb8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Synapse as dynamical interface", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1db2f291-4d92-9145-ad95-2c3e1814c1ae"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1.1. Why the synapse is not just an edge", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"28df0529-cf27-4d48-8005-fb40641e1106"],

Cell["\<\
In simplified artificial neural networks, a connection is often treated as a \
scalar weight. This is inadequate biologically and computationally.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5ba9b59e-fd21-e441-b4c5-7e51ee65f604"],

Cell["A synapse is a structured dynamical process involving: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bc6dffec-2bce-214a-9837-b98820097407"],

Cell["transmitter release,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ab02dbdd-ef2c-6142-9ca8-6eaa6efbc6a2"],

Cell["receptor binding,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c985799e-efeb-8a43-aaeb-9337841cddde"],

Cell["conductance change,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6fa0e376-4bec-2b4c-8818-89db63e64259"],

Cell["voltage dependence,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ca6845d2-7cd1-9744-bc80-bd2158ae2527"],

Cell["stochasticity,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3544b986-9941-b645-9643-01ae5036edd0"],

Cell["delay,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f026077d-d1b2-b348-816e-46028fda8680"],

Cell["short-term state,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"89caea89-e0a7-8a4a-91ec-a8b0685b2d00"],

Cell["long-term plastic modification,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"e543a92f-1d70-bc4e-9c7f-d0cd2c1cb1da"],

Cell["modulatory context,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b45f2452-36d6-c540-b703-28b62f954126"],

Cell["possible glial participation.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3cc683e7-f844-bd4e-b02a-07227187eb31"],

Cell["\<\
Thus a synapse should be modeled as an interface system, not merely a \
parameter. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b698c71c-b1f8-d64e-a843-bf2d6b734621"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1.2. General synaptic current", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"3afbd4e8-ba4f-f448-bf07-195300466816"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A synaptic current entering a compartment is typically written as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["syn", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["syn", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["syn", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "I_{\\mathrm{syn}}(t) = g_{\\mathrm{syn}}(t) \
\\big(V(t)-E_{\\mathrm{syn}}\\big)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ec83f77b-3d47-6443-b749-02626343b7e4"],
 "where: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"257ee76f-5f5d-cd42-9ff7-d235b30d9d7b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["syn", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "g_{\\mathrm{syn}}(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ec9958ba-23c1-004e-b80f-f6b1aae2eaf3"],
 " is the time-varying synaptic conductance,"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d9daed17-afdf-4942-91dc-6a011a67ca96"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["syn", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "E_{\\mathrm{syn}}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c557b32c-e850-7345-b384-5d475e9c5055"],
 " is the synaptic reversal potential."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9d819151-05a5-9945-874a-dd60f32bc29e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For multiple synapses, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["syn", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "I_{\\mathrm{syn}}(t) = \\sum_j g_j(t)\\big(V(t)-E_j\\big).", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "85a630b6-191a-5c46-91ac-18af93760b28"],
 "This is the canonical conductance-based synaptic form. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"97d4471c-98e7-a244-b850-f3440ef5323b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"417715d1-bfca-d842-8d40-96d537b14f4c"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Event-driven synaptic conductance models", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"02358d0d-a06d-7e4a-a17a-731457c3f292"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2.1. Single exponential response", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"35d910e4-83a7-784b-af4e-937b32bbb2d7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A minimal synaptic conductance model triggered by a presynaptic spike train \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"{", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "}"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\{t_k\\}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "276d8d92-6141-5a40-9fd6-116bec45fc46"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["g", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
           StyleBox["s", "TI"]]], "+", 
         UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[Delta]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\frac{dg}{dt} = -\\frac{g}{\\tau_s} + \\sum_k w_k \\delta(t-t_k)", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fdda8fb2-edb6-4b41-859e-929e0e8994ee"],
 "where: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"44d5aa81-9e7f-e549-9b5f-55dbe0e9a40b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
        StyleBox["s", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\tau_s", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "302c6dc1-337c-5340-b591-6c5aa7f1af74"],
 " is the synaptic decay time,"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"89e9a44b-7ef2-554b-a316-1d8947da0b93"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "w_k", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "653ca4cb-b0af-ec4a-813e-a85a4c2891bc"],
 " is the conductance increment per presynaptic event."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"022f1692-2f3d-da41-8227-fa4c8fd0d37e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2.2. Double exponential response", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"20711eac-7a99-3443-bae7-60b25e0f0a5b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A more realistic conductance kernel uses distinct rise and decay: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "0"], 
         UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{"-", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
                    SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
                    StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "/", 
                SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
                 StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "-", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{"-", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
                    SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
                    StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "/", 
                SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
                 StyleBox["r", "TI"]]}]]}], ")"}], 
         StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "g(t) = g_0 \\sum_k \\left(e^{-(t-t_k)/\\tau_d} - \
e^{-(t-t_k)/\\tau_r}\\right) H(t-t_k)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "cc934c53-f205-f642-bb47-5646c24d9f9f"],
 "where: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"340a002e-5199-5c40-a864-a350c6b82181"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
        StyleBox["r", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\tau_r", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6884c7e0-0713-1141-b3df-4da5c77a9636"],
 " = rise time,"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4b95b12f-493b-d64f-a4e4-c6b0ec1789d8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
        StyleBox["d", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\tau_d", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e5876602-c58f-2544-b68c-174a148298e1"],
 " = decay time,"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b41346e5-f6ba-fd4f-8549-911738f5ee5b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["H", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "H", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0e79b8a0-f869-ec41-b66e-bde9cd34ed14"],
 " = Heaviside step function."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d1e82057-b38e-7141-8737-ce527da8bd29"],

Cell["\<\
This captures the noninstantaneous onset of receptor activation. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7b0c82c7-8c27-2e4f-bbe3-5c5a9fdeb4e5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2.3. Alpha-function synapse", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0ff54acd-c42b-9e4d-9de4-0f8232c9bc8e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An alternative form is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "0"], 
         UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
           StyleBox["s", "TI"]]], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
                StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
                SubscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "/", 
            SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
             StyleBox["s", "TI"]]}]], 
         StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "g(t) = g_0 \\sum_k \\frac{t-t_k}{\\tau_s} e^{1-(t-t_k)/\\tau_s} \
H(t-t_k).", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "244adda5-81ce-f342-9aa4-eb81381a2544"],
 "This is computationally convenient and often used in reduced models. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f807055-3832-d844-8f28-01461389ca4a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c85cb946-ee55-6e41-8703-2647d3003a7e"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Receptor classes", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0c1b8394-db94-3341-ade2-ddf6e8ea417a"],

Cell["\<\
Different receptors imply different kinetics and nonlinearities. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b4f76cbc-490e-da4c-b2ac-2ac642943e80"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.1. Fast excitatory receptors", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0226beb4-91f4-494d-94df-dcc7bb03a317"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "AMPA-like currents are often approximated as fast excitatory conductances: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["AMPA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["AMPA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["V", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["AMPA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "I_{\\mathrm{AMPA}} = g_{\\mathrm{AMPA}}(t)(V-E_{\\mathrm{AMPA}})", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "961bda40-aace-cb4b-8b11-2d45866e3c8e"],
 "with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["AMPA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[TildeTilde]", "0", 
         " mV"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "E_{\\mathrm{AMPA}} \\approx 0 \\text{ mV}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9de141f5-f1e7-9c48-bb36-10ad038f19d9"],
 " and fast decay. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ddf99114-f40e-ee4f-b938-41b03c9c39db"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.2. Slow voltage-dependent excitatory receptors", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"bfb28fe5-9f41-f440-a4e2-fcfdf0c98e2c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "NMDA-like currents are slower and voltage dependent due to magnesium block. \
A simplified form is: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["NMDA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["NMDA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], 
         StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["V", "TI"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["V", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["NMDA", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "I_{\\mathrm{NMDA}} = g_{\\mathrm{NMDA}}(t) B(V)(V-E_{\\mathrm{NMDA}})", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8604dfa1-d407-ec49-9ba1-614a1630d429"],
 "where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["B", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["V", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "B(V)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bc065008-6a70-d64d-965f-eb27f8d39f64"],
 " is a voltage-dependent unblock factor."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b1c62869-cf0e-af48-a75c-3eef6d5f5847"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A common phenomenological form is: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["V", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", 
          RowBox[{"1", "+", "\[Eta]", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"-", "\[Zeta]", 
               StyleBox["V", "TI"]}]]}]], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "B(V) = \\frac{1}{1 + \\eta e^{-\\zeta V}}.", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "876d0d1b-1830-f244-b950-756941f80feb"],
 "This creates coincidence sensitivity and nonlinear dendritic integration. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dd3f08b5-3c6f-7341-898e-def68cc2cebb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.3. Inhibitory receptors", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d0c71934-042a-e944-be36-e0d97e8cde6f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Fast inhibitory currents are often modeled as: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["GABA_A", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["GABA_A", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["V", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["inh", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "I_{\\mathrm{GABA_A}} = g_{\\mathrm{GABA_A}}(t)(V-E_{\\mathrm{inh}})", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bfc10e4b-50bb-6b4b-8d9b-75dcb3dc5ea1"],
 "with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["inh", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "E_{\\mathrm{inh}}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8fb16a02-f56b-d843-93b3-08be1d9f8012"],
 " typically negative relative to resting potential."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7a7e793f-c336-2b49-98f5-cbe80db76918"],

Cell["\<\
Slower metabotropic inhibition can be modeled with additional state \
variables. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"db4833d9-85b2-0743-9a38-18487715f445"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d7f3915f-db8c-6347-899a-343a7597fd4f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Synaptic delays and transmission timing", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3ae96799-2984-134c-8e56-e73b1be5f3ca"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4.1. Delay representation", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"204dd00a-170e-1d4b-8926-5bb3afe6a22c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Synaptic transmission is not instantaneous. If a presynaptic spike occurs \
at time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_k", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c24e81f5-db24-4746-bb74-5ba58f3a0f70"],
 ", its effect may begin at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "+", 
         StyleBox["d", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_k + d", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4834c968-1647-1545-9b1e-41f5f17afe60"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"266bcdfd-a7ab-9945-9bcc-a17fbe4e2f8d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Then ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["g", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
           StyleBox["s", "TI"]]], "+", 
         UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[Delta]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "+", 
                 StyleBox["d", "TI"]}], ")"}]}], ")"}], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\frac{dg}{dt} = -\\frac{g}{\\tau_s} + \\sum_k w_k \\delta(t-(t_k+d)).",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f4635394-6e23-3b47-9343-42ba734127a3"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8b083ee1-7db1-d64e-a42c-0d4982598bca"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4.2. Why timing matters", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"2909bc0d-6a2a-f348-ae78-76ceb623f1bc"],

Cell["Delays are critical for: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8a883972-4a9c-3046-aac8-0fc55672b34d"],

Cell["synchronization,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1215eaff-6f9e-ad4b-b005-67eb3a26cef3"],

Cell["oscillations,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ce96db8e-c312-c248-9666-ac943b52012f"],

Cell["spike timing dependent plasticity,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a88aab39-3ab3-1e4c-9cab-32a58a287767"],

Cell["sequence learning,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"83c6df05-f7e7-1d44-8bac-9c11f4b2d45b"],

Cell["reverberatory loops.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"35ea05d7-c2b7-0e4e-aec6-d8993bc72706"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"ecc4ebea-c09c-6c42-89e8-80725609ef7a"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5. Short-term synaptic plasticity", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4eb52184-5350-2c4e-9f2d-f95fbd69b57c"],

Cell["\<\
Short-term plasticity captures transient changes in efficacy on timescales of \
milliseconds to seconds. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"98d065ad-1161-344c-a67f-7d0054f7b735"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5.1. Resource-utilization framework", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d788e33e-0741-7346-a360-fc3ce47662e1"],

Cell["\<\
A widely useful model represents synaptic efficacy by interacting variables: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"052a8471-987c-a54e-81f7-c53bb112fbf2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "available resources ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "R(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b6fbd6ab-771b-aa48-a0e5-d0795ceed519"],
 ","
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"011caaf1-cf26-f24e-b730-8728bbb84888"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "utilization ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "u(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "987d215b-27c1-ff46-b885-1c32c2d20030"],
 "."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6b9d6b04-0f59-c84b-8341-ca1600c754fa"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Upon a presynaptic spike at time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_k", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8870dafa-266a-c642-8570-b0d3e07dda88"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubsuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"], "+"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubsuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-"], ")"}], "+", 
         StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
             StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               SubsuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
                StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-"], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm],
      "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "u(t_k^+) = u(t_k^-) + U\\big(1-u(t_k^-)\\big)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "330a34fd-85f6-6144-810e-9ff215097a78"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubsuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"], "+"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubsuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-"], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
             StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               SubsuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
                StyleBox["k", "TI"], "+"], ")"}]}], ")"}], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "R(t_k^+) = R(t_k^-)\\big(1-u(t_k^+)\\big).", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e30fc8ad-2a71-0a46-ae76-5503dfb840ef"],
 "Between spikes: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["u", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["u", "TI"], "-", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["U", "TI"], "0"]}], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
           StyleBox["f", "TI"]]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\frac{du}{dt} = -\\frac{u-U_0}{\\tau_f}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "043abc5a-96ef-c54e-b2f0-12df875eda11"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
           StyleBox["r", "TI"]]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\frac{dR}{dt} = \\frac{1-R}{\\tau_r}.", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c68ceefc-c883-4d4a-8712-937a03b4ce28"],
 "Then effective conductance increment is proportional to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "uR", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "05f9b700-f41d-bc4c-b890-b5bbc247ebd2"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d0a3dd62-d269-2341-85ae-084f97f789b5"],

Cell["This captures facilitation and depression. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"59666de0-9a36-064d-b539-16942688a761"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5.2. Computational significance", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"95ff3bf8-9eff-d34c-b38c-5607855e9137"],

Cell["Short-term plasticity gives synapses: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ae1635c1-bbfa-cf42-944d-c938d16e5528"],

Cell["temporal filtering,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9eca9754-d3c8-394e-9be2-326610c28ecd"],

Cell["adaptive gain control,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"bb644c64-554b-c243-b2b0-175e94bfaf43"],

Cell["novelty sensitivity,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"701271b4-5268-174d-a38c-e3c0fb7a1665"],

Cell["burst selectivity,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b993419a-61e6-1746-8a2c-d7379c7e48a1"],

Cell["input history dependence.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9e025ba1-33a1-4f4c-b4c9-7c370a9396e3"],

Cell["These are highly relevant for AI design. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"27cc7f28-6a87-3d4d-b68f-d9a4450804c1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"0a8c89f8-991e-5345-8985-964e4e2fd1e7"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6. Long-term synaptic plasticity", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f654bea9-b382-284a-8da3-1e1ffac944c6"],

Cell["\<\
Long-term plasticity modifies connection strength persistently. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3f56e874-f6cb-e646-96d4-469df00f404a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6.1. Hebbian prototype", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fa092c89-8875-a24c-b416-6aae15dc592f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A minimal Hebbian update is: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["w", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "\[Eta]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["pre", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["post", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\frac{dw}{dt} = \\eta x_{\\mathrm{pre}} x_{\\mathrm{post}}", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4f667f96-a4d9-144d-8484-3229b1fbf781"],
 "where: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e80c550-c9bd-a540-b7a6-590269213108"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["w", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "w", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "712d04bb-8464-8d42-8eb3-5dc68df865f8"],
 " = synaptic strength,"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8fa5807f-ab24-af45-a88c-bd0f084b87b8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["pre", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "x_{\\mathrm{pre}}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9ecd5301-e0b6-3f47-a57e-a8054fb102ae"],
 " = presynaptic activity,"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b0121cf2-0654-6f40-881e-91d7fe93052b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["post", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "x_{\\mathrm{post}}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2f53d006-be0f-1646-9ff5-5dcf187053ac"],
 " = postsynaptic activity."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c4b80ad1-f023-754f-b64c-a12cc7c135bd"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6.2. Oja stabilization", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"3be0e4b9-1fc4-a04b-8138-2841dd41049f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Unbounded Hebbian growth is unstable. Oja\[CloseCurlyQuote]s rule adds \
normalization: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["w", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "\[Eta]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["pre", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["post", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "-", 
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["post", FontSlant -> "Plain"], "2"], 
             StyleBox["w", "TI"]}], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\frac{dw}{dt} = \\eta \\big(x_{\\mathrm{pre}} x_{\\mathrm{post}} - x_{\
\\mathrm{post}}^2 w\\big).", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "624fb595-e4c4-0949-8c4c-76792ba2d898"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bb353d44-d50c-0f4b-8730-4fdb20300074"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6.3. Spike timing dependent plasticity", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d2168058-7133-f643-9992-9f0588fa90f7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "STDP uses the relative timing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["post", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["pre", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\Delta t = t_{\\mathrm{post}} - t_{\\mathrm{pre}}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "06443b32-46bf-f14d-abf6-353e01e7bdee"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
         StyleBox["w", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              GridBox[{{
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    RowBox[{
                    SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "+"], 
                    SuperscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
                    RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalDelta]", 
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", 
                    SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", "+"]}]], ","}]], "InlineFormula"], 
                    " "}]], 
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula"], 
                    " "}]]}, {
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    RowBox[{"-", 
                    SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "-"], 
                    SuperscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
                    RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", 
                    SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", "-"]}]], ","}]], "InlineFormula"], 
                    " "}]], 
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "<", "0"}]], "InlineFormula"], 
                    " "}]]}}], TraditionalForm]]]}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\Delta w =\n\\begin{cases}\nA_+ e^{-\\Delta t/\\tau_+}, & \\Delta t > \
0 \\\\\n-A_- e^{\\Delta t/\\tau_-}, & \\Delta t < 0\n\\end{cases}", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bb4c8f19-5592-344f-a461-01a640b73110"],
 "This is a core timing-based learning rule. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"07efc307-b30a-4241-a48b-88060169c1bb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6.4. Homeostatic stabilization", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"aa12b662-75a2-6a4c-86cc-0805571ddaaa"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Plasticity often requires global or local homeostasis, for example: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["w", "TI"]}], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "\[Eta] ", 
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]", 
          StyleBox["plasticity", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "-", "\[Lambda]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["w", "TI"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["w", "TI"], "0"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\frac{dw}{dt} = \\eta \\, \\Pi_{\\mathrm{plasticity}} - \\lambda \
(w-w_0)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4670b4e2-6e33-af48-882a-78d9851040ae"],
 "where the second term stabilizes around a target scale. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2763bcfa-49f5-8049-ac8b-25f2333ace8e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"55b36c46-de2c-5b42-ab22-22f4a7094cdf"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7. Structural plasticity", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"da094e09-cf87-204e-b9d4-60146bfaf5a7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7.1. Beyond weight change", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"6b7e57c1-c48e-b146-a825-a7eb3c36bca4"],

Cell["\<\
Real neurons do not only change synaptic strength; they also modify: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7de92c5e-959a-7147-8b29-23389372d659"],

Cell["spine density,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"dd087a14-cc19-f54b-afe4-7169b5db2783"],

Cell["branch growth,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ed898bd5-53f5-9848-b517-00551f6dd9a4"],

Cell["pruning,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"aac904bf-6817-9c42-a17b-6103f6ab1f21"],

Cell["contact probability.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d767bdd5-201e-a943-b691-192ed31667ef"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7.2. Graph-level formalization", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"2bbc66e3-fa57-3848-874d-5bcf6741f0d7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let the connectivity graph be ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["G", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "G(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "47ed33af-4486-6b4c-96da-5d6dbf448f05"],
 ". Structural plasticity is then: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "\[CapitalDelta]", 
             StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["struct", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], ",", 
             StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], ",", "\[CapitalTheta]"}], ")"}]}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "G(t+\\Delta t) = \\mathcal{U}_{\\mathrm{struct}}(G(t), X(t), \\Theta)", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "15d88839-bee0-4047-b864-a784779c86c4"],
 "where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["X", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "X(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4f51be10-1c9a-a148-bfa6-27b4db4ff4b1"],
 " includes activity and local state."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e63a9526-2fc8-3a41-beb3-73c4d327a41c"],

Cell["\<\
This is important if the eventual AI system is to learn architecture rather \
than only weights. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d47d98a4-3aa5-044e-9fc1-77e5c5381222"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"eedd0bca-ec0c-b64c-bbda-65e4c4e59107"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8. Neuromodulation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"df6e7522-9b80-6049-a363-cdfd11fc93fa"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8.1. Slow context-dependent modulation", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fb5384a9-63b8-424e-9f83-24e0ce1f3923"],

Cell["\<\
Many neural systems are shaped by diffuse modulatory signals. These do not \
simply excite or inhibit; they alter gain, plasticity, thresholds, or time \
constants. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"04376959-571d-c549-a127-e7325565273e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["8.2. Formalization", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d8ae0600-766d-e143-8144-5c8303f9e550"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["mod", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "m_{\\mathrm{mod}}(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "04c46d02-0e79-7244-9cf0-faadbae60c64"],
 " be a modulatory state variable. Then parameters may become state \
dependent: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
          StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "\[Rule]", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
          StyleBox["m", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["mod", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], ")"}], ",    ", "\[Eta]", 
         "\[Rule]", "\[Eta]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["mod", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], ")"}], ",    ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["th", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[Rule]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["th", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["mod", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], ")"}], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\tau_m \\to \\tau_m(m_{\\mathrm{mod}}), \\qquad\n\\eta \\to \
\\eta(m_{\\mathrm{mod}}), \\qquad\nV_{\\mathrm{th}} \\to V_{\\mathrm{th}}(m_{\
\\mathrm{mod}}).", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "91cfac13-6b73-0b4d-a915-87e5e74a94c3"],
 "This is crucial for richer adaptive computation. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ccffcb8a-18d0-2046-9e69-0f6ea4997ced"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   FrameStyle->Directive[
     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"83dbf209-d69b-774e-b62d-e5fc657ce0c8"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["9. Astrocytes and glia", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"668f1970-b652-f94f-92fe-db64fbb0ce87"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["9.1. Why glia matter", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"6d4029e9-699f-f54a-b836-c0a44f17d1c9"],

Cell["\<\
A neuron-only picture is incomplete. Astrocytes and other glial cells: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0e2e8d60-c819-b24e-ba3b-df8b07c00c11"],

Cell["regulate transmitter levels,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"02e5c6c4-d16a-594e-9597-53f765e9c99a"],

Cell["buffer ions,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"e0aed92d-872c-3643-88b5-81ee7d015ad4"],

Cell["modulate synaptic efficacy,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ad9d114e-c11a-1847-8962-805b07192b79"],

Cell["participate in metabolic support,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"2f370318-9fe5-c14e-85cc-f145a5942b4a"],

Cell["introduce slower spatially structured dynamical processes.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ee9e9900-c558-1344-b9bd-9e499627eccc"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
9.2. Tri ... uto does not claim those laws are already established here.\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"2f822174-795e-074e-9832-251365d61a40"],

